{"unit_id": "tag:023X:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个态射族（family of morphisms），其目标（target）为<MATH_0003>。置<MATH_0004>，并将其视为<MATH_0005>-概形（scheme）。存在一个典范（canonical）的范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATHSEG_0001>下降（descent）数据（data）的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0002>相对于族（family）<MATHSEG_0003>下降（descent）数据（data）的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0004>相对于<MATHSEG_0005>\n它将<MATH_0006>映射（maps）到<MATH_0007>，其中<MATH_0008>且<MATH_0009>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "基概形和其上的概形。"}, {"source_term": "family of morphisms", "target_term": "态射族", "context": "给定的同目标态射族。"}, {"source_term": "target", "target_term": "目标", "context": "态射的共同目标。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范", "context": "由不交并给出的范畴等价。"}, {"source_term": "equivalence of categories", "target_term": "范畴等价", "context": "两种下降数据范畴之间的等价。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "两种下降数据的限定。"}, {"source_term": "data", "target_term": "数据", "context": "相对于态射族与其不交并的下降数据。"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴", "context": "两种下降数据的范畴。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "相对下降所用的族。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "范畴等价在对象上的对应。"}], "notes": []}
{"unit_id": "tag:023X:proof", "translation": "注意<MATH_0001>，高阶（higher）纤维积（fibre products）也类似。给定一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>恰好等同于给定一个族（family）<MATH_0003>。而给定一个下降（descent）数据（datum）<MATH_0004>恰好等同于给定一个族（family）<MATH_0005>。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "higher", "target_term": "高阶"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "higher", "target_term": "高阶", "context": "更高重数的纤维积。"}, {"source_term": "fibre products", "target_term": "纤维积", "context": "不交并的高阶纤维积。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "到不交并的态射。"}, {"source_term": "family", "target_term": "族", "context": "由不交并分解获得的族。"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降", "context": "下降数据的限定。"}, {"source_term": "datum", "target_term": "数据", "context": "给定的一个下降数据。"}], "notes": []}
